NOTE on 'bash scripts/verify_m0_local.sh exit=2' above:
  This script is NOT one of the six static gates, and it does not complete on
  this machine for a reason unrelated to T-03 -- it aborts in its **agent**
  block (wt-media-agent/scripts/build.sh, line 36 of the script) because
  'uv build' wants to fetch hatchling from PyPI and this sandbox has no
  network. See t03-m0-local.out for the full trace.
  The desktop block is the script's LAST step (line 42-45), so it never ran
  inside this script. It was exercised directly instead --
  'cd wt-media-desktop && scripts/test.sh' -> exit=0 (t03-desktop-test-sh.out).
  Under the exception rule this is the honest reading: the M0 local script is
  red in this environment, and the red is in another repo's build step.
